    "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5",
    "seconds": 21,
    "summary": "The root cause was the `paymentFailure` feature flag in the `flagd-config` ConfigMap. Its `defaultVariant` was `\"100%\"`, so every payment charge request failed.\n\nI set `defaultVariant` to `\"off\"` and restarted the `flagd` deployment so it loads the change. The rollout finished. All pods were already Running before the change. I haven't run a test checkout, so I haven't confirmed that payments now succeed.\n\nThe ConfigMap had no `last-applied-configuration` annotation, so `kubectl apply` printed a warning and patched it in. The edit itself applied normally.",
